The Afterburner authors modified the sources: the IO boundary runs on the
nuclei runtime instead of Tokio, and the crate is renamed and versioned with
the Afterburner workspace. The changes are recorded in the Afterburner
repository's history (https://github.com/afterburner-sh/afterburner).
